      "comment": "UNHURRIED (1) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 25.16 beating Mythic. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Expected to be right there at the finish again. EVA CARGO (7) has a strong overall record having seven wins and two places from 11 starts but was out of the money last time when fifth (25.53) over 431m at this track. Will go close here with a clear run. ARMATREE JUDO (2) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and five minors from 12 tries. Hit the frame latest (25.15) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. ZIPPING HOLLY (4) has claims again if she runs up to the latest effort.",
